    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say things get better but it just feels like a lie. every time i think i've turned a corner i just end up right back here, feeling like a failure. it's like i'm just waiting for the next crash. if the outcome is always going to be the same, what's even the point of the struggle? it just feels like there's no actual exit from this cycle.",
